name=Axion Super Power Saving
version=v3.6.0
versionCode=52
author=Axion SPSM
description=v3.6.0 the swipe is gone: the phone runs on three buttons while the mode is on, so Back is Back, Home is this home and the Recents button opens this mode's own list - and that list has Clear all, which closes every open task and stops the frozen background in one press. Apps outside your six are stopped outright when the screen goes off so their memory comes back, and the ROM's own background work is restricted per package while asleep and put back on wake. RMX3430.
